This product is a modified version of the Discord channel plugin for
Claude Code ("discord" 0.0.4 from the claude-plugins-official marketplace),
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The first commit of this repository contains the upstream files unchanged.
Every later change is a separate, reviewable commit. In summary, the
modifications are:

- Shared state helpers and an append-only JSONL audit log (lib/state.ts,
  lib/audit.ts).
- Roles, an owner flag and guild-level grants in access.json; senders
  without a role are not delivered (default deny); the inbound gate moved
  to lib/access.ts. New access commands: role, owner, guild grant/revoke/list.
- A per-role tool policy (policy/default-policy.json, lib/policy.ts) with a
  strict shell allowlist for git, gh, package managers and read-only
  utilities (lib/shell.ts, lib/paths.ts).
